id: pm-csv-sdk-write-fence
title: Host SDK allows stale item writes after lease takeover
description: "PR 179 thread PRRT_kwDOSYpI8s6vNO6H identifies missing atomic lease/revision fencing in the host SDK. The original real non-git reproduction demonstrates lost updates on lease takeover. The owner authorized a pm-csv callback deadline mitigation: refuse elapsed callbacks at effective TTL minus margin, preserving newer SDK/CLI writes in passing regressions. The root atomic persistence fix belongs upstream in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1549. This follow-up remains open for upstream verification; callback deadlines alone cannot protect arbitrary SDK delays outside the callback."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-cli#1549"
created_at: "2026-10-22T13:46:22.966Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T11:16:27.156Z"
author: codex-agent
expected_result: "The host atomically refuses stale item persistence when lease ownership or document revision changed, preserving the newer value and allowing safe transaction reconciliation."
actual_result: "Original unguarded SDK reproduction loses the newer value. Package mitigation now refuses an over-budget callback before returning: real SDK and separate CLI takeover cases pass 2/2; reverting only guardEditMutation fails 0/2 and overwrites newer values. Integration guards also pass. This is not an atomic persistence fence: SDK delays before callback entry or after return remain upstream in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1549, verified by the owner on 2026.10.22. No upstream edit or dependency bump."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T16:12:05.186Z",codex-agent,"Owner-authorized callback deadline mitigation is implemented and covered in the normal suite. pm test pm-csv-sdk-write-fence --run --progress --timeout 600 passed 2/2 real takeover regressions, preserving newer SDK and separate CLI values with typed csv_lease_expired. Restoring only guardEditMutation fails both cases (0/2, exit 1, newer values overwritten), then restored fixed bytes pass. Both full npm and Bun release gates pass 315/315 and unchanged 100/100/100 coverage across six sources. Atomic persistence fencing still belongs upstream in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1549; arbitrary SDK delays outside the callback remain unprotected. Retain this item in progress for orchestrator/upstream verification and release the claim."
  "2026-10-23T11:12:27.825Z",codex-agent,"PR 177 compatibility assessment: pm-cli 2026.10.23 release and PR 1550 implement GH-1549 native lease/revision fencing. Real unguarded SDK takeover probe loses the newer title on 2026.10.20 but refuses stale persistence and preserves the newer title on 2026.10.23. A future supported-host-floor upgrade can replace callback-only csv_lease_expired guards on native paths with host lock_lost/stale_revision refusal coverage; extension lock overrides remain provider-owned. No pins or mitigation changed in this PR. Evidence: docs/compatibility-2026.10.20.md."
